Plan-Id: paperps-step3-calibration-2026-09-06-v1
Protocol-Id: paperps-inference-2026-09-05-v2.2
Frozen-On: 2026-09-06
Status: prospective_calibration_plan_frozen_simulation_not_run
Design-Template-Ids: br2017,gs2020,sw2022
Design-Input-Policy: response_free_deltaX_Z_respondent_and_task_layout_only
Application-Outcomes-Permitted: false
Oracle-Calibration-Replications-Per-Cell: 2000
Oracle-Validation-Replications-Per-Cell: 2000
Numerical-Calibration-Replications-Per-Targeted-Cell: 40
Numerical-Validation-Replications-Per-Targeted-Cell: 40
Numerical-Calibration-Replications-Per-Interpretation-Cell: 8
Numerical-Validation-Replications-Per-Interpretation-Cell: 8
Oracle-Calibration-Master-Seed: 100000000
Oracle-Validation-Master-Seed: 500000000
Numerical-Calibration-Master-Seed: 900000000
Numerical-Validation-Master-Seed: 1300000000
Seed-Formula: master+(design_index-1)*30000000+(regime_index-1)*2000000+replication
Maximum-Workers: 10
Nominal-Coverage: 0.95
Minimum-Benign-Calibration-Passage: 0.90
Maximum-Targeted-Calibration-False-Certification: 0.01
Validation-Monte-Carlo-Interval: two_sided_wilson_95_percent
Validation-Coverage-Criterion: well_informed_unconditional_and_release_conditional_point_estimates_at_least_0.94_and_95_percent_wilson_intervals_contain_0.95
Validation-Benign-Passage-Criterion: point_estimate_at_least_0.90_and_95_percent_wilson_lower_bound_at_least_0.88
Validation-Targeted-False-Certification-Criterion: oracle_point_estimate_at_most_0.05_and_95_percent_wilson_upper_bound_at_most_0.07_within_each_design;pooled_numerical_point_estimate_at_most_0.01_and_95_percent_wilson_upper_bound_at_most_0.05
Validation-Benign-Constraint-Criterion: empty_and_uninformative_point_rates_at_most_0.01_and_95_percent_wilson_upper_bounds_at_most_0.02
Validation-Numerical-Completion-Criterion: all_targeted_runs_finite;pooled_well_informed_passage_at_least_0.90;all_interpretation_runs_reported_without_hard_gate_calibration_claim
Candidate-Grid: observed_finite_metric_values_plus_adjacent_machine_representable_endpoints
Threshold-Rule: maximize_benign_passage_subject_to_minimum_benign_passage_and_maximum_targeted_false_certification_then_minimize_false_certification_then_choose_stricter_cutoff
Threshold-Equality-Policy: comparator_equality_passes_with_exact_double_comparison_and_no_hidden_tolerance
Boundary-Alias-Policy: aliases_share_one_registry_constant_and_must_be_bit_identical
Infeasible-Rule: retain_proposal_with_infeasible_status_and_do_not_create_production_manifest
Validation-Rule: evaluate_once_on_untouched_validation_stream_and_never_retune_under_this_plan_id
Production-Manifest-Creation: conditional_on_all_frozen_validation_criteria_passing
